---
kind: lore
id: departure
title: Leaving the Hearth
---
/* `departure` is a select: sequence occasion: every eligible entry plays, in
order. The send-off runs once per NPC (for="kind:npc") who has given Wren a
keepsake and trusts her, in member order: Maud, Oskar, Sable. */

<entry id="stairDoor" on="departure" priority="10">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: The door to the Stair stands open. It always does. That is the worst thing about it.
</entry>

<entry id="sendOff" on="departure" for="kind:npc" once="run" when="user.bond[occasion.target] >= 3 && holds('keepsakeFrom', [occasion.target])">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: {{occasion.target}} looks up as she passes.
  <match on="occasion.target">
    <when is="maud">
      @maud{code="0010" emotion="fond"}: Kettle'll be on. Mind the ankles.
    </when>
    <when is="oskar">
      @oskar{code="0010" emotion="wry"}: Hit it hard. Then hit it again.
    </when>
    <when is="sable">
      @sable{code="0010"}: Come back with your shadow.
    </when>
  </match>
</entry>
